## Authentication routes

### Login
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "ayman@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345"
}


### Register
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "aymam",
  "email": "ayman@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "phone": "+212600000001",
  "roleId": 1
}


### Logout
POST localhost:8080/api/v1/logout
Content-Type: application/json